@School.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

### Health
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Create department
POST {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SCI",
  "name": "Ciencias",
  "description": "Departamento de ciencias"
}

### List departments
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Accept: application/json

### Create course (replace departmentId with an existing department GUID)
POST {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "BIO-101",
  "name": "Biologia",
  "credits": 3,
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "instructorId": null
}

### List students
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### List instructors
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instructors
Accept: application/json
